# An implementation id selects it and shows its title; a reply with two actions keeps one; declining writes nothing.
id: codify-named-id
skill: highway-codify
fixture: implementation
open: /highway-codify RIde140b32
ask: Would you like to explore any of these options?
say: [select] Check reorder points every night, and also email the store manager a monthly summary.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [decline] Cancel this.
covers: d6438e900c5e A supplied id selects the matching accepted implementation, and the title is shown afterward.
covers: f9cc62afad04 A second action waits for another run. Declining writes nothing. Accepting is the only confirmation.
covers: 9dde8c6abcab Declining a proposal writes nothing.
reaches: suggest
reaches: propose
